WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:36.780
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.050 --> 01:38.880
[The Lament of Autumn]

3
01:39.370 --> 01:41.759
[Episode 4]

4
01:45.340 --> 01:46.000
Look!

5
01:46.340 --> 01:47.700
Isn't that Fifth Young Master Yu?

6
01:47.700 --> 01:48.640
It really is him.

7
01:48.680 --> 01:49.479
It's him.

8
01:49.560 --> 01:51.220
That's Fifth Young Master Yu!

9
01:51.420 --> 01:52.630
It really is!

10
01:52.870 --> 01:54.289
Why is he with Ye Pingjun?

11
01:55.370 --> 01:55.850
Why is he

12
01:55.850 --> 01:56.840
with Ye Pingjun?

13
01:56.840 --> 01:58.570
What exactly are you trying to do?

14
01:58.570 --> 01:59.570
Isn't it obvious?

15
02:00.050 --> 02:03.110
An older brother is taking his little sister to school.

16
02:03.670 --> 02:04.270
No need.

17
02:04.800 --> 02:06.230
When a woman turns you down,

18
02:06.230 --> 02:08.020
a man should try even harder.

19
02:08.050 --> 02:09.979
That's what courting is all about.

20
02:15.340 --> 02:16.470
Shameless.

21
02:16.970 --> 02:18.660
There's more where that came from.

22
02:18.660 --> 02:19.720
Want to see?

23
02:25.480 --> 02:27.340
Isn't that Fifth Young Master Yu?

24
02:27.410 --> 02:29.280
Why is he with Ye Pingjun?

25
02:33.970 --> 02:36.250
No wonder he fired a gun for Ye Pingjun.

26
02:36.520 --> 02:38.430
Has he changed his type again?

27
02:44.630 --> 02:46.090
Who he takes to school

28
02:46.090 --> 02:47.150
or spends time with

29
02:47.180 --> 02:48.720
is none of my business.

30
02:50.540 --> 02:52.520
[Xiangxi Hotel]

31
02:54.860 --> 02:55.520
Changxuan,

32
02:55.740 --> 02:56.870
we just got word

33
02:57.579 --> 02:58.300
that Tao Xili has secured

34
02:58.300 --> 02:59.690
a loan from the central government.

35
02:59.690 --> 03:00.690
The funds were meant

36
03:00.690 --> 03:02.090
to provide relief for flood victims,

37
03:02.090 --> 03:03.190
but the Tao and Mu families

38
03:03.190 --> 03:05.390
are using them to buy Japanese weapons.

39
03:05.630 --> 03:07.030
This is a serious matter.

40
03:07.210 --> 03:09.010
Should we inform the Commander?

41
03:10.800 --> 03:11.900
The weapons

42
03:12.460 --> 03:13.990
will come ashore at Xishui.

43
03:14.360 --> 03:15.760
I'll seize the shipment.

44
03:20.340 --> 03:21.800
Isn't that a bit too risky?

45
03:26.400 --> 03:27.530
A nation's downfall

46
03:29.220 --> 03:31.860
lies in the incompetence of its generals and soldiers.

47
03:31.860 --> 03:33.920
To restore order and save the nation,

48
03:34.280 --> 03:35.540
nothing is more urgent

49
03:36.740 --> 03:38.670
than strengthening the military.

50
03:41.280 --> 03:42.150
I understand.

51
03:42.860 --> 03:43.300
You want

52
03:43.300 --> 03:44.960
to build your own loyal force,

53
03:45.030 --> 03:46.960
equipped with weapons of your own.

54
03:47.680 --> 03:48.530
What I want

55
03:50.250 --> 03:51.800
is true independence,

56
03:52.530 --> 03:53.900
not to be a pawn

57
03:53.900 --> 03:55.560
manipulated by the old guard.

58
03:57.480 --> 04:00.090
But with just our own men,

59
04:00.120 --> 04:01.780
seizing the weapons on our own

60
04:01.810 --> 04:02.870
will be difficult.

61
04:02.910 --> 04:03.840
That's why

62
04:05.150 --> 04:06.090
I'll work with a trusted aide

63
04:06.090 --> 04:07.630
of Marshal Xu.

64
04:08.580 --> 04:09.560
You mean

65
04:10.330 --> 04:11.020
Staff Officer Yang?

66
04:11.020 --> 04:12.020
Staff Officer Li.

67
04:13.620 --> 04:14.880
Fifth Young Master Yu,

68
04:15.810 --> 04:17.630
that was a pretty underhanded move.

69
04:17.630 --> 04:19.160
What are you going on about?

70
04:20.120 --> 04:22.100
I'm talking about that plot of land on Changping Mountain.

71
04:20.220 --> 04:21.540
[Folder]

72
04:23.040 --> 04:24.750
That land belongs to Tao Ziyi's uncle, right?

73
04:24.750 --> 04:26.120
You were hot and cold with Tao Ziyi,

74
04:26.120 --> 04:28.050
deliberately playing hard to get,

75
04:28.600 --> 04:29.370
all for that piece of land,

76
04:29.370 --> 04:30.100
weren't you?

77
04:30.870 --> 04:32.330
You're getting smarter.

78
04:33.330 --> 04:34.680
I'm as sharp as a tack.

79
04:41.180 --> 04:42.500
No wonder!

80
04:44.430 --> 04:46.330
I always thought Ye Pingjun

81
04:46.330 --> 04:47.680
was a pretty little thing,

82
04:47.680 --> 04:49.270
but I couldn't figure out what you saw in her.

83
04:49.270 --> 04:51.130
So you were using her

84
04:51.130 --> 04:52.890
to make Tao Ziyi jealous.

85
04:55.740 --> 04:57.070
Oh, my dear brother,

86
04:57.090 --> 04:59.409
why keep this from me?

87
04:59.440 --> 05:00.900
I'm an expert when it comes

88
05:01.480 --> 05:02.610
to love and romance.

89
05:02.930 --> 05:03.660
Leave it to me

90
05:03.830 --> 05:05.860
to make Tao Ziyi eat out

91
05:05.930 --> 05:07.890
of your hand.

92
05:07.910 --> 05:09.570
I'll make sure everything goes smoothly,

93
05:09.570 --> 05:11.370
every step of the way.

94
05:11.870 --> 05:12.730
What do you say?

95
05:16.370 --> 05:17.040
Miss Ye,

96
05:17.220 --> 05:18.330
Lan Qing gave me

97
05:18.470 --> 05:20.100
the script you wrote last time.

98
05:20.100 --> 05:20.830
I've read it,

99
05:21.300 --> 05:22.630
and it's quite impressive.

100
05:22.630 --> 05:23.360
Your writing

101
05:23.390 --> 05:25.070
doesn't read like that of a student still in school.

102
05:25.070 --> 05:25.810
You write

103
05:25.830 --> 05:28.800
like a seasoned screenwriter who's written several scripts.

104
05:28.800 --> 05:30.680
Director Liang, you're too kind.

105
05:30.690 --> 05:31.540
I've only

106
05:31.570 --> 05:33.480
read a few books here and there

107
05:33.500 --> 05:35.630
and tried writing a few pieces myself.

108
05:35.870 --> 05:36.510
Pingjun,

109
05:36.830 --> 05:39.090
Director Liang genuinely admires your work.

110
05:39.090 --> 05:40.360
Once your script is staged,

111
05:40.360 --> 05:41.900
it'll surely be more moving

112
05:41.930 --> 05:43.100
than any of the new plays out there.

113
05:43.100 --> 05:43.830
Absolutely.

114
05:47.240 --> 05:48.070
Lan Qing,

115
05:48.100 --> 05:49.300
Fifth Young Master Yu sent word

116
05:49.300 --> 05:50.650
that he'll be here shortly.

117
05:50.650 --> 05:51.250
All right.

118
05:53.140 --> 05:54.200
Oh, Lan Qing,

119
05:54.230 --> 05:54.970
I need to go back

120
05:54.970 --> 05:56.240
and get some medicine for my mother,

121
05:56.240 --> 05:58.010
so I'll be off now.

122
05:58.270 --> 05:58.870
All right.

123
05:59.100 --> 06:00.300
Take care on your way.

124
06:01.280 --> 06:02.340
I'll take my leave.

125
06:03.190 --> 06:03.810
Take care.

126
06:07.240 --> 06:08.080
I'm off.

127
06:11.170 --> 06:14.860
[Yuchun Theater]

128
06:23.830 --> 06:24.890
Are you here alone?

129
06:27.130 --> 06:28.040
Stop looking.

130
06:28.240 --> 06:29.370
She's already gone.

131
06:32.120 --> 06:33.740
Who said I was looking for anyone?

132
06:33.740 --> 06:35.100
I came to see you.

133
06:36.390 --> 06:37.830
Word's all over town

134
06:38.390 --> 06:40.150
that you're courting Pingjun.

135
06:40.500 --> 06:41.740
You even made a big show of it

136
06:41.740 --> 06:44.340
by chasing her all the way to the girls' school.

137
06:46.250 --> 06:46.890
What,

138
06:47.510 --> 06:48.310
jealous?

139
06:52.180 --> 06:53.540
Cut the nonsense.

140
06:53.750 --> 06:54.680
I'm warning you,

141
06:55.090 --> 06:56.600
you need to stop this.

142
06:58.000 --> 06:59.830
Pingjun is an innocent girl.

143
07:00.190 --> 07:02.250
I treat her like my own little sister.

144
07:03.430 --> 07:05.120
It's only been a few days,

145
07:05.230 --> 07:07.490
and you're already so protective of her?

146
07:07.520 --> 07:08.480
She's nothing

147
07:08.480 --> 07:10.240
like all those girls you fool around with.

148
07:10.240 --> 07:12.240
She's a decent, respectable girl.

149
07:15.680 --> 07:16.810
What a coincidence.

150
07:17.470 --> 07:19.290
I've been wanting to make

151
07:19.740 --> 07:22.070
a new, respectable friend.

152
07:32.760 --> 07:35.510
[Mingde Girls' High School]

153
07:33.680 --> 07:34.450
See you tomorrow.

154
07:34.450 --> 07:35.159
Goodbye.

155
07:35.620 --> 07:36.080
I'm off.

156
07:36.250 --> 07:37.909
Today's lessons were so hard.

157
07:41.130 --> 07:41.659
Pingjun,

158
07:42.100 --> 07:43.430
the homework you've been doing for us

159
07:43.430 --> 07:44.390
has gotten better and better.

160
07:44.390 --> 07:45.720
We're all very pleased.

161
07:45.830 --> 07:46.860
A new roller rink just opened

162
07:46.860 --> 07:48.460
near the Bell and Drum Tower.

163
07:48.680 --> 07:49.830
We're going to check it out.

164
07:49.830 --> 07:50.560
Come with us.

165
07:52.130 --> 07:52.970
I don't know how to roller-skate.

166
07:52.970 --> 07:54.330
I don't want to spoil your fun,

167
07:54.330 --> 07:55.190
so I'll pass.

168
07:57.300 --> 07:58.659
Other girls at our school

169
07:58.659 --> 07:59.690
offer to do homework for money, too,

170
07:59.690 --> 08:01.200
but we've always chosen you.

171
08:01.200 --> 08:02.460
Is this how you treat us

172
08:02.520 --> 08:04.040
after we've invited you out for the first time?

173
08:04.040 --> 08:05.240
It's okay if you don't know how to roller-skate.

174
08:05.240 --> 08:06.570
We can teach you.

175
08:06.830 --> 08:07.890
Come on!

176
08:07.890 --> 08:08.890
The more, the merrier.

177
08:08.890 --> 08:10.090
Come on, it'll be fun!

178
08:10.550 --> 08:12.510
[Roller Rink]

179
08:15.620 --> 08:17.250
[Skate Safely, Have Fun!]

180
08:19.820 --> 08:20.740
Ye Pingjun,

181
08:20.760 --> 08:21.990
what are you doing over there?

182
08:21.990 --> 08:23.020
Come on over!

183
08:24.480 --> 08:25.780
Holding on like that,

184
08:25.820 --> 08:27.430
how are you ever going to learn?

185
08:27.430 --> 08:28.450
You've got to be willing to fall

186
08:28.450 --> 08:29.870
if you want to learn.

187
08:29.980 --> 08:31.080
-Right. -Right.

188
08:31.230 --> 08:32.700
Let's help her skate together.

189
08:32.700 --> 08:33.760
-Come on. -Come on.

190
08:33.890 --> 08:34.480
Come on.

191
08:39.390 --> 08:40.799
Make sure you keep your balance.

192
08:40.799 --> 08:42.049
Roller-skating is easy.

193
08:42.049 --> 08:42.919
You'll get the hang of it in no time.

194
08:42.919 --> 08:43.549
Exactly.

195
09:10.290 --> 09:11.440
Sorry,

196
09:11.460 --> 09:12.720
I couldn't stop in time.

197
09:12.720 --> 09:13.500
Are you okay?

198
09:26.700 --> 09:27.880
I'm so sorry.

199
09:28.040 --> 09:29.030
I didn't see you.

200
09:52.460 --> 09:53.770
Watch where you're going.

201
09:53.770 --> 09:54.860
Be more careful!

202
09:54.880 --> 09:56.480
Exactly! What are you doing?

203
10:22.000 --> 10:22.940
It's skating.

204
10:23.790 --> 10:25.390
Falling is part of learning, isn't it?

205
10:25.390 --> 10:27.320
You don't know how? I'll teach you.

206
10:27.630 --> 10:29.760
I've got something to do. I'm leaving.

207
10:32.360 --> 10:33.190
What are you doing?

208
10:33.190 --> 10:33.840
You actually—

209
10:33.840 --> 10:34.440
My hand...

210
10:36.870 --> 10:38.000
Ye Pingjun,

211
10:38.280 --> 10:40.300
how dare you hurt me like that?

212
10:43.220 --> 10:44.100
It's skating.

213
10:45.530 --> 10:47.890
Bumping into someone is pretty normal, isn't it?

214
10:47.890 --> 10:49.620
I'll be more careful next time.

215
10:56.770 --> 10:57.830
Are you okay?

216
10:58.290 --> 10:59.690
Come on, get up. Careful.

217
11:25.340 --> 11:28.220
[Roller Rink]

218
11:27.600 --> 11:28.330
Are you okay?

219
11:30.910 --> 11:32.150
Should we go to the hospital?

220
11:32.150 --> 11:32.950
I'll take you.

221
11:37.450 --> 11:39.980
No need to trouble you, Fifth Young Master Yu.

222
11:43.550 --> 11:46.010
It's no trouble. I'm headed that way anyway.

223
11:50.880 --> 11:51.570
This way.

224
11:55.410 --> 11:55.930
Get in.

225
12:11.650 --> 12:14.310
Are you sure you don't need to go to the hospital?

226
12:15.130 --> 12:15.700
I'm fine.

227
12:17.550 --> 12:19.360
Next Wednesday is my birthday.

228
12:19.980 --> 12:20.720
I want you

229
12:21.050 --> 12:21.980
to attend

230
12:21.980 --> 12:22.630
as my date.

231
12:24.500 --> 12:25.170
No way.

232
12:28.290 --> 12:30.090
Don't want your indenture back?

233
12:32.910 --> 12:34.040
If you do this for me,

234
12:34.390 --> 12:35.590
I'll waive six months

235
12:35.690 --> 12:37.290
off our one-year agreement.

236
12:40.340 --> 12:40.870
Deal?

237
12:44.360 --> 12:44.980
Deal.

238
13:03.070 --> 13:03.900
Fifth Young Master Yu,

239
13:03.900 --> 13:05.410
they may shower you with gold and silver,

240
13:05.410 --> 13:07.810
but this is what really matters.

241
13:08.670 --> 13:10.920
Premium astragalus root helps replenish your qi

242
13:10.920 --> 13:13.000
and promote good health. It'll do you a world of good.

243
13:13.000 --> 13:14.440
And I personally selected

244
13:14.440 --> 13:15.750
every single piece.

245
13:15.750 --> 13:16.680
How thoughtful.

246
13:17.670 --> 13:18.790
Ye Pingjun?

247
13:19.750 --> 13:21.010
What's she doing here?

248
13:23.080 --> 13:23.580
Right!

249
13:24.980 --> 13:26.220
Isn't she that brat

250
13:26.220 --> 13:27.350
from Xiangxi Hotel?

251
13:27.580 --> 13:28.720
Isn't she afraid you'll settle the score with her?

252
13:28.720 --> 13:29.630
You didn't hear?

253
13:29.630 --> 13:30.790
Fifth Young Master Yu is courting her.

254
13:30.790 --> 13:31.910
Really?

255
13:36.450 --> 13:38.310
Miss Ye is my honored guest.

256
13:38.620 --> 13:40.390
Whatever misunderstandings there may have been in the past,

257
13:40.390 --> 13:41.390
we're all friends

258
13:41.730 --> 13:42.770
from now on.

259
13:45.980 --> 13:47.290
Miss Ye,

260
13:47.370 --> 13:48.770
I was out of line before.

261
13:48.790 --> 13:50.450
Please don't take it to heart.

262
13:51.240 --> 13:52.440
I was out of line, too.

263
13:52.530 --> 13:53.240
I'm sorry.

264
14:00.030 --> 14:00.790
This German-style pistol

265
14:00.790 --> 14:02.130
was custom-made for you, Fifth Young Master Yu.

266
14:02.130 --> 14:03.650
Even British dukes use this model.

267
14:03.650 --> 14:04.820
This is a tiger descending the mountain,

268
14:04.820 --> 14:06.220
a symbol of wealth and peace.

269
14:06.220 --> 14:07.670
I hope you'll accept it, Fifth Young Master Yu

270
14:07.670 --> 14:08.740
I had someone bring this riding crop

271
14:08.740 --> 14:10.200
back from Britain for you.

272
14:10.530 --> 14:11.950
The handle is made of rhinoceros horn,

273
14:11.950 --> 14:13.770
and the whip is crafted from fine calfskin.

274
14:13.770 --> 14:14.960
See if it suits you.

275
14:15.170 --> 14:16.200
Thank you, Yayi.

276
14:16.340 --> 14:17.010
I love it.

277
14:17.750 --> 14:18.890
Eldest Young Lady Tao really knows

278
14:18.890 --> 14:20.200
how to give Fifth Young Master Yu exactly what he wants.

279
14:20.200 --> 14:20.850
Indeed.

280
14:20.870 --> 14:21.630
-That's right. -That's right.

281
14:21.630 --> 14:22.460
Miss Ye,

282
14:22.910 --> 14:23.910
what have you prepared

283
14:23.910 --> 14:25.370
for Fifth Young Master Yu?

284
14:28.250 --> 14:28.940
I know

285
14:29.050 --> 14:31.340
Fifth Young Master Yu usually favors Western things,

286
14:31.340 --> 14:33.470
but I couldn't afford a birthday cake,

287
14:33.550 --> 14:35.530
so I made one myself.

288
14:45.060 --> 14:47.360
I hope you won't mind, Fifth Young Master Yu

289
14:47.360 --> 14:50.240
What's that supposed to be?

290
14:51.160 --> 14:53.620
Is that supposed to be Fifth Young Master Yu?

291
14:54.190 --> 14:55.890
That's way too abstract.

292
14:56.050 --> 14:57.260
It is Fifth Young Master Yu.

293
14:57.260 --> 14:58.770
Now, in all fairness,

294
14:59.630 --> 15:00.360
it may

295
15:01.030 --> 15:02.720
look abstract,

296
15:02.740 --> 15:03.860
but it does capture

297
15:03.890 --> 15:05.310
some of his essence.

298
15:05.870 --> 15:07.400
No, I mean, your essence...

299
15:11.630 --> 15:12.840
It may not be particularly refined,

300
15:12.840 --> 15:13.530
but you can tell

301
15:13.530 --> 15:15.260
she put a lot of thought into it.

302
15:15.670 --> 15:16.890
I really appreciate

303
15:18.500 --> 15:19.440
the sentiment.

304
15:20.240 --> 15:21.770
I'm glad you like it, Fifth Young Master Yu.

305
15:21.770 --> 15:22.390
Now,

306
15:23.150 --> 15:25.350
let's put in the candles and make a wish.

307
15:46.720 --> 15:48.330
-Great! -Great!

308
15:53.340 --> 15:53.890
Miss Ye,

309
15:54.650 --> 15:55.940
here's the knife you asked for.

310
15:55.940 --> 15:56.360
Here,

311
15:56.720 --> 15:57.450
give it to me.

312
15:57.630 --> 15:58.890
Fifth Young Master Yu.

313
16:01.870 --> 16:03.770
Looks like she's going to

314
16:04.170 --> 16:06.030
take Fifth Young Master Yu apart.

315
16:11.030 --> 16:11.890
Let me help you.

316
16:22.130 --> 16:23.990
Don't get yourself into trouble.

317
16:32.550 --> 16:34.000
Ye Pingjun is

318
16:34.000 --> 16:35.500
clearly messing with Fifth Young Master Yu.

319
16:35.500 --> 16:36.150
In the past,

320
16:36.150 --> 16:37.950
he would've taught her a lesson for this.

321
16:37.950 --> 16:40.050
Fifth Young Master Yu isn't even angry with her now.

322
16:40.050 --> 16:41.250
Keep your voice down.

323
17:15.640 --> 17:17.040
Come on, get on the horse.

324
17:29.900 --> 17:31.430
-What are you doing? -Hyah!

325
17:32.940 --> 17:35.000
That's Fifth Young Master Yu for you!

326
17:36.800 --> 17:38.310
Ye Pingjun seems

327
17:38.310 --> 17:39.560
so prim and proper at school.

328
17:39.560 --> 17:42.090
Who knew she was such a seductress in private?

329
17:42.730 --> 17:44.190
If you ask me, Yu Changxuan

330
17:44.230 --> 17:45.490
is the real sly fox.

331
17:47.270 --> 17:48.510
Stop the horse! Stop!

332
17:48.530 --> 17:49.940
You weren't afraid of dying

333
17:49.940 --> 17:51.030
when you insulted me

334
17:51.030 --> 17:52.960
under the guise of giving me a gift.

335
17:53.160 --> 17:54.560
If you don't want to fall,

336
17:54.640 --> 17:55.640
behave yourself.

337
17:59.070 --> 18:00.140
Let go of me!

338
18:00.500 --> 18:01.480
Let me go!

339
18:12.530 --> 18:13.900
Let me down!

340
18:28.200 --> 18:28.900
Put me down!

341
18:30.740 --> 18:32.400
If you want something from me,

342
18:32.590 --> 18:34.390
shouldn't you change your tone?

343
18:44.140 --> 18:45.290
Please let me down.

344
19:04.490 --> 19:06.090
I thought we'd settled this.

345
19:06.660 --> 19:07.720
I didn't expect you

346
19:08.590 --> 19:10.200
to be so uncooperative.

347
19:10.370 --> 19:12.060
Yes, I agreed to be your date.

348
19:13.330 --> 19:13.730
But not

349
19:13.730 --> 19:15.390
to get this intimate with you.

350
19:17.330 --> 19:18.500
What's the difference?

351
19:18.500 --> 19:19.650
Once this is over,

352
19:19.960 --> 19:21.160
you can walk away unscathed.

353
19:21.160 --> 19:21.960
What about me?

354
19:22.700 --> 19:23.680
How am I supposed

355
19:23.680 --> 19:25.210
to deal with all the gossip?

356
19:26.570 --> 19:27.970
Are you lecturing me now?

357
19:31.830 --> 19:33.160
You know

358
19:33.160 --> 19:34.200
I'm no gentleman.

359
19:35.610 --> 19:36.740
Let me ask you again.

360
19:39.150 --> 19:40.320
What am I to you?

361
19:47.240 --> 19:47.770
My boss.

362
20:09.840 --> 20:11.100
Second Young Lady Tao,

363
20:12.270 --> 20:13.400
what can I do for you?

364
20:18.980 --> 20:21.250
You flirt with both

365
20:21.250 --> 20:22.880
respectable ladies and loose women.

366
20:22.880 --> 20:24.540
How could I dare approach you?

367
20:26.140 --> 20:27.700
You're a lady of good breeding, too.

368
20:27.700 --> 20:28.470
Have you

369
20:29.090 --> 20:30.090
no manners?

370
20:30.260 --> 20:32.190
At least I have more class than you.

371
20:32.270 --> 20:32.790
Keeping company

372
20:32.790 --> 20:34.390
with someone so beneath you—

373
20:34.880 --> 20:35.660
aren't you afraid

374
20:35.660 --> 20:37.590
of bringing disgrace on yourself?

375
20:38.530 --> 20:41.330
Second Young Lady Tao, if you have something to say,

376
20:41.330 --> 20:42.530
why not just say it instead of speaking in riddles?

377
20:42.530 --> 20:43.640
Don't play dumb.

378
20:43.680 --> 20:45.940
I'm obviously talking about Ye Pingjun.

379
20:48.570 --> 20:50.640
Pingjun is gentle and well-behaved.

380
20:51.830 --> 20:53.270
What has she done to offend you?

381
20:53.270 --> 20:55.130
She has no place here.

382
20:55.150 --> 20:56.190
Make her leave.

383
20:59.180 --> 21:01.000
Since when do I, Yu Changxuan,

384
21:01.030 --> 21:02.230
need your permission

385
21:03.270 --> 21:04.730
to associate with anyone?

386
21:09.030 --> 21:10.990
If you don't care about your own reputation,

387
21:10.990 --> 21:12.000
aren't you afraid

388
21:12.000 --> 21:14.000
of tarnishing the Yu family's name?

389
21:14.880 --> 21:17.440
What does my reputation or the Yu family's

390
21:19.790 --> 21:21.100
have to do with you?

391
21:46.850 --> 21:47.660
Turns out,

392
21:48.270 --> 21:50.200
clothes really do make the person.

393
21:50.480 --> 21:52.740
You look pretty good all dressed up.

394
21:54.850 --> 21:56.270
She's long gone.

395
21:56.920 --> 21:58.520
You can stop pretending now.

396
22:00.270 --> 22:01.730
What are you trying to say?

397
22:02.400 --> 22:03.970
I'd been wondering

398
22:04.200 --> 22:06.030
why you insisted on choosing me

399
22:06.330 --> 22:07.980
as your date.

400
22:08.790 --> 22:09.830
Turns out,

401
22:10.750 --> 22:12.150
it's because of Tao Ziyi.

402
22:16.060 --> 22:17.020
Go on.

403
22:18.160 --> 22:19.330
I just realized

404
22:19.540 --> 22:20.520
that every time

405
22:20.550 --> 22:22.550
you acted all affectionate with me,

406
22:22.720 --> 22:24.030
Tao Ziyi was there.

407
22:24.900 --> 22:25.860
Tell me,

408
22:26.180 --> 22:27.980
isn't it strange

409
22:28.290 --> 22:29.830
that you'd enjoy

410
22:29.860 --> 22:31.740
making the woman you love unhappy?

411
22:31.740 --> 22:32.530
Either

412
22:33.180 --> 22:34.780
you have an ulterior motive,

413
22:35.640 --> 22:36.480
or

414
22:37.140 --> 22:38.200
you're an idiot.

415
22:49.770 --> 22:51.180
You're very clever.

416
22:52.060 --> 22:52.610
But

417
22:53.640 --> 22:56.040
being too clever isn't always a good thing.

418
22:56.830 --> 22:58.110
The more you know,

419
22:59.090 --> 23:00.440
the sooner you'll die.

420
23:07.070 --> 23:08.200
I don't know exactly

421
23:08.700 --> 23:09.860
what you're after

422
23:09.890 --> 23:11.330
with Tao Ziyi,

423
23:12.230 --> 23:14.340
but you probably don't want her

424
23:14.500 --> 23:14.900
finding out about your little game

425
23:14.900 --> 23:16.560
of playing hard to get, do you?

426
23:25.200 --> 23:26.530
Are you threatening me?

427
23:26.660 --> 23:27.420
No.

428
23:29.270 --> 23:30.070
I just want

429
23:30.070 --> 23:31.470
to renegotiate our deal.

430
23:33.330 --> 23:34.330
What do you want?

431
23:35.050 --> 23:36.450
I'll cooperate with you,

432
23:37.120 --> 23:38.540
but you can't

433
23:39.270 --> 23:41.370
just waive six months of my indenture.

434
23:41.370 --> 23:42.590
Once this is over,

435
23:43.350 --> 23:45.410
you have to return my indenture to me.

436
23:52.900 --> 23:53.700
Fine,

437
23:55.740 --> 23:57.770
but you have to give it your all.

438
23:57.980 --> 23:58.740
No problem,

439
24:00.040 --> 24:02.300
as long as I can get out of this indenture.

440
24:06.680 --> 24:08.010
Then I'll see you later.

441
24:09.550 --> 24:11.880
I'm looking forward to your performance.

442
24:24.750 --> 24:25.550
Everyone,

443
24:27.830 --> 24:29.290
I'd like to say a few words.

444
24:29.570 --> 24:30.400
Today

445
24:30.920 --> 24:33.070
is Fifth Young Master Yu's birthday banquet.

446
24:33.070 --> 24:35.270
Someone as young and accomplished as Fifth Young Master Yu,

447
24:35.270 --> 24:36.440
with both talent and virtue,

448
24:36.440 --> 24:38.530
is truly a rare find.

449
24:38.590 --> 24:39.960
Wherever you go,

450
24:39.960 --> 24:42.090
everyone looks up to you.

451
24:42.460 --> 24:43.070
So,

452
24:43.180 --> 24:43.660
let me

453
24:44.310 --> 24:45.830
start by raising three toasts to you.

454
24:45.830 --> 24:46.290
Cheers!

455
24:48.140 --> 24:49.070
What a drinker!

456
24:49.200 --> 24:51.060
Boren can really hold his liquor.

457
24:53.550 --> 24:54.810
Fifth Young Master Yu,

458
24:55.330 --> 24:56.530
have something to eat

459
24:56.530 --> 24:57.660
before you drink.

460
24:59.230 --> 24:59.850
Everyone,

461
25:01.000 --> 25:03.500
ask yourselves honestly:

462
25:04.500 --> 25:05.480
who among you

463
25:06.030 --> 25:08.760
hasn't received help from Fifth Young Master Yu?

464
25:09.480 --> 25:10.030
Who

465
25:10.590 --> 25:12.530
hasn't been given a leg up by him?

466
25:22.680 --> 25:23.140
I'm

467
25:24.570 --> 25:26.380
wholeheartedly devoted to you.

468
25:26.720 --> 25:28.770
Fifth Young Master Yu, I'll follow you for the rest of my life.

469
25:28.770 --> 25:29.580
Enough said.

470
25:29.770 --> 25:31.380
Let me have another big drink.

471
25:31.380 --> 25:31.880
Cheers!

472
25:33.570 --> 25:35.250
Good! Good!

473
25:45.400 --> 25:46.000
You...

474
25:47.050 --> 25:48.510
No, Fifth Young Master Yu,

475
25:49.090 --> 25:49.980
you don't have

476
25:49.980 --> 25:51.570
to be so moved by what I just said.

477
25:51.570 --> 25:51.940
I...

478
25:52.460 --> 25:53.200
I meant every word

479
25:53.200 --> 25:54.070
from the bottom of my heart.

480
25:54.070 --> 25:54.650
You're

481
25:55.200 --> 25:57.000
making me embarrassed.

482
25:58.040 --> 26:00.170
Don't be like that, don't be like that.

483
26:04.800 --> 26:06.060
Fifth Young Master Yu,

484
26:09.830 --> 26:10.680
is it good?

485
26:12.640 --> 26:13.440
Delicious.

486
26:13.800 --> 26:15.130
Anything you feed me

487
26:15.610 --> 26:16.550
tastes good.

488
26:33.180 --> 26:33.980
Everyone,

489
26:34.920 --> 26:36.230
my sister and I

490
26:36.380 --> 26:37.720
have prepared some evening entertainment

491
26:37.720 --> 26:39.180
for Fifth Young Master Yu.

492
26:39.400 --> 26:40.670
Here's how it works:

493
26:40.770 --> 26:41.980
the men and women

494
26:41.980 --> 26:43.110
will each draw lots.

495
26:43.570 --> 26:45.700
Whichever boat you draw is the one you board,

496
26:45.700 --> 26:47.770
and the pairings will be entirely random.

497
26:47.770 --> 26:49.220
Whoever fate brings together

498
26:49.220 --> 26:51.270
can enjoy a moonlit boat ride and admire the lanterns together.

499
26:51.270 --> 26:52.130
What do you say?

500
26:52.350 --> 26:54.660
[Male Guests] [Female Guests]

501
26:52.770 --> 26:53.570
Sounds great!

502
26:54.010 --> 26:55.160
As the poem goes,

503
26:55.240 --> 26:57.680
"as wine takes hold, spring desires awaken;

504
26:57.680 --> 27:00.700
beneath embroidered quilts, mandarin ducks ride waves of passion."

505
27:00.700 --> 27:02.100
Now that's interesting.

506
27:07.970 --> 27:09.220
[Female Guests]

507
27:09.380 --> 27:10.240
Fold them up

508
27:10.240 --> 27:11.110
just as I instructed.

509
27:11.110 --> 27:11.770
-Yes. -Yes.

510
27:13.580 --> 27:15.780
[Tao Ziyi] [Yu Changxuan]

511
27:15.030 --> 27:15.900
Yayi,

512
27:16.310 --> 27:17.440
can you guarantee

513
27:17.440 --> 27:20.110
I'll end up on the same boat as him?

514
27:21.640 --> 27:22.550
Don't worry.

515
27:22.370 --> 27:24.340
[Tao Ziyi] [Yu Changxuan]

516
27:24.370 --> 27:26.030
[Yu Changxuan]

517
27:41.660 --> 27:42.480
You don't need to help me.

518
27:42.480 --> 27:43.680
I can get down myself.

519
27:46.010 --> 27:47.010
Have fun.

520
27:59.380 --> 28:00.420
Why is it you?

521
28:01.700 --> 28:02.900
What's wrong with me?

522
28:03.350 --> 28:04.420
Why is it you?

523
28:07.530 --> 28:09.240
Did you rig the draw?

524
28:09.240 --> 28:10.900
I swear I didn't rig anything!

525
28:10.980 --> 28:12.400
And now you're acting all hurt?

526
28:12.400 --> 28:12.830
I...

527
28:12.830 --> 28:13.850
What bad luck.

528
28:14.330 --> 28:15.660
It's my birthday party.

529
28:16.030 --> 28:16.790
Of course things

530
28:16.790 --> 28:17.960
go the way I want.

531
28:21.570 --> 28:22.680
Look for yourself.

532
28:23.240 --> 28:24.970
The boats have already set off,

533
28:25.070 --> 28:27.330
and everyone's watching from the shore.

534
28:27.880 --> 28:28.960
Even if you go out there now,

535
28:28.960 --> 28:30.680
you won't get on Fifth Young Master Yu's boat.

536
28:30.680 --> 28:31.480
Why don't we

537
28:31.640 --> 28:33.510
just make do with each other?

538
28:37.180 --> 28:38.220
Why did you hit me?

539
29:10.110 --> 29:13.170
Why are we getting farther and farther from the others?

540
29:15.530 --> 29:16.330
Looks like

541
29:17.740 --> 29:18.240
we're spending the night

542
29:18.240 --> 29:19.810
on this little boat.

543
29:21.900 --> 29:23.360
I'd swim back if I had to.

544
29:31.830 --> 29:33.360
Let's finish the job first.

545
29:33.970 --> 29:35.230
Then you can swim back.

546
30:07.160 --> 30:07.750
Let's go.

547
30:20.110 --> 30:22.110
Why are there so many soldiers here?

548
30:22.590 --> 30:23.640
If you don't want to die,

549
30:23.640 --> 30:24.940
do exactly as I say.

550
30:42.570 --> 30:43.830
Fifth Young Master Yu,

551
30:44.070 --> 30:45.260
you must go alone.

552
30:51.520 --> 30:52.630
This is my woman.

553
30:52.940 --> 30:54.940
Not a hair on her head is to be harmed.

554
30:56.340 --> 30:58.340
Don't worry, Fifth Young Master Yu.

555
31:01.440 --> 31:03.240
If anyone dares lay a hand on you,

556
31:03.660 --> 31:04.590
shoot them.

557
31:05.220 --> 31:06.050
I'll take

558
31:06.390 --> 31:07.650
full responsibility.

559
31:25.700 --> 31:27.330
All this for some spoiled young master,

560
31:27.330 --> 31:28.030
keeping us

561
31:28.030 --> 31:29.180
up late

562
31:30.570 --> 31:31.440
and freezing out here

563
31:31.440 --> 31:32.980
in the middle of nowhere.

564
31:33.200 --> 31:34.000
Meanwhile,

565
31:34.420 --> 31:35.900
he's got a wineglass in one hand

566
31:35.900 --> 31:37.160
and a beauty in the other,

567
31:37.160 --> 31:38.390
living it up.

568
31:44.510 --> 31:45.840
What are you looking at?

569
31:46.380 --> 31:48.030
A playboy like you

570
31:48.240 --> 31:48.920
should stay snug

571
31:48.920 --> 31:49.790
in your little

572
31:49.790 --> 31:50.530
love nest.

573
31:50.660 --> 31:52.720
And you think you can strike a deal with Staff Officer Yang?

574
31:52.720 --> 31:53.660
Dream on!

575
31:56.850 --> 31:57.510
Stand down!

576
32:05.510 --> 32:06.700
When I got the news,

577
32:06.700 --> 32:07.960
I couldn't believe it.

578
32:08.220 --> 32:09.480
Fifth Young Master Yu,

579
32:10.160 --> 32:12.250
you really did dare to come alone.

580
32:13.830 --> 32:15.290
The plan we're discussing

581
32:15.610 --> 32:16.870
would benefit us both.

582
32:17.240 --> 32:18.770
Why bring troops into this?

583
32:18.830 --> 32:19.940
"Benefit us both?"

584
32:21.030 --> 32:23.180
You're getting ahead of yourself.

585
32:25.220 --> 32:27.720
Fifth Young Master Yu, you want to join forces

586
32:27.720 --> 32:28.850
with us to hijack the arms shipment

587
32:28.850 --> 32:30.850
the Tao and Mu families are smuggling.

588
32:30.850 --> 32:32.530
But you can

589
32:32.530 --> 32:34.680
only command a dozen or so men.

590
32:35.270 --> 32:37.110
You expect us to do all the work,

591
32:37.790 --> 32:39.570
spend our own resources,

592
32:40.460 --> 32:41.250
and risk making enemies of both families

593
32:41.250 --> 32:43.570
based on nothing but your words?

594
32:44.350 --> 32:46.010
Any way you look at it,

595
32:47.330 --> 32:49.510
it's a losing deal.

596
32:58.770 --> 33:00.110
I have the exact landing time and location

597
33:00.110 --> 33:02.590
for that arms shipment.

598
33:03.570 --> 33:05.140
Without my intelligence,

599
33:06.880 --> 33:10.210
Staff Officer Yang, taking the whole shipment for yourself

600
33:10.640 --> 33:12.240
would be next to impossible.

601
33:17.640 --> 33:18.440
Besides,

602
33:20.090 --> 33:22.220
Marshal Xu commands three divisions,

603
33:22.530 --> 33:23.050
but

604
33:23.530 --> 33:25.230
his troops are still equipped

605
33:25.350 --> 33:26.770
with outdated weapons.

606
33:28.070 --> 33:29.380
He's been worried

607
33:30.400 --> 33:31.940
about getting new ones.

608
33:33.810 --> 33:34.880
Am I wrong?

609
33:35.750 --> 33:36.460
And

610
33:37.330 --> 33:38.870
I recommend that Marshal Xu

611
33:39.030 --> 33:40.830
join Third Master Cheng's camp.

612
33:41.030 --> 33:42.490
Because if war breaks out,

613
33:43.070 --> 33:44.930
Premier Rui won't stand a chance.

614
33:46.640 --> 33:48.900
Premier Rui is at the height of his power.

615
33:51.140 --> 33:53.640
What makes you think he'll lose?

616
33:56.920 --> 33:57.420
All right,

617
33:57.420 --> 33:58.220
yours is done.

618
33:58.680 --> 34:00.080
What do you want to write?

619
34:00.170 --> 34:01.940
Miss, please tell my mother

620
34:02.000 --> 34:03.570
I've received the cotton shoes

621
34:03.570 --> 34:04.730
she sent me last time.

622
34:04.730 --> 34:05.330
All right.

623
34:05.570 --> 34:06.430
Anything else?

624
34:07.220 --> 34:08.130
That's all for now.

625
34:08.130 --> 34:08.840
Okay.

626
34:08.840 --> 34:09.570
Me, me.

627
34:09.780 --> 34:10.300
Miss,

628
34:10.400 --> 34:11.570
please tell my father

629
34:11.570 --> 34:12.480
not to overwork himself

630
34:12.480 --> 34:13.800
during the autumn harvest.

631
34:13.800 --> 34:14.380
He can

632
34:14.440 --> 34:15.710
ask my maternal uncle and the others for help.

633
34:15.710 --> 34:16.050
All right.

634
34:16.050 --> 34:16.730
I'll thank them in person

635
34:16.730 --> 34:17.989
when I get home.

636
34:18.190 --> 34:18.880
Okay.

637
34:18.880 --> 34:19.380
Oh,

638
34:19.510 --> 34:21.010
I want to write to my father, too.

639
34:21.010 --> 34:22.739
Then I want to write to my mother.

640
34:22.739 --> 34:23.960
Don't rush. Take your time.

641
34:23.960 --> 34:24.650
I'll write yours first.

642
34:24.650 --> 34:25.150
Okay.

643
34:25.210 --> 34:25.610
Here.

644
34:25.670 --> 34:26.400
I just can't read it.

645
34:26.400 --> 34:27.330
Autumn harvest.

646
34:29.380 --> 34:30.000
Pu,

647
34:30.480 --> 34:30.920
look

648
34:31.050 --> 34:32.260
what I've written!

649
34:57.420 --> 34:58.920
What time is it already?

650
35:06.050 --> 35:07.450
Why aren't they back yet?

651
35:09.420 --> 35:10.440
Don't worry.

652
35:10.680 --> 35:13.230
Director Gu has already sent people to look for them.

653
35:13.230 --> 35:16.030
Maybe they stopped somewhere to admire the scenery

654
35:16.030 --> 35:17.290
and lost track of time.

655
35:19.460 --> 35:20.460
If you ask me,

656
35:20.630 --> 35:23.010
maybe they got carried away by their feelings

657
35:23.010 --> 35:25.270
and decided to spend the night together.

658
35:27.530 --> 35:28.860
Why did you hit me again?

659
35:29.510 --> 35:31.040
Because you're shameless.

660
35:31.110 --> 35:31.880
I—

661
35:31.880 --> 35:32.630
Ziyi.

662
35:33.480 --> 35:34.070
I—

663
35:34.920 --> 35:35.380
Well...

664
35:35.960 --> 35:37.760
was I really shameless just now?

665
35:44.780 --> 35:46.040
Fifth Young Master Yu,

666
35:46.340 --> 35:47.400
I won't see you out.

667
35:48.130 --> 35:49.060
Until next time.

668
35:49.530 --> 35:50.460
Until next time.

669
35:59.570 --> 36:00.700
Staff Officer Yang,

670
36:00.710 --> 36:02.110
I just don't understand.

671
36:02.130 --> 36:03.190
Why agree to work

672
36:03.260 --> 36:05.060
with a spoiled rich kid like him?

673
36:08.590 --> 36:10.780
Premier Rui is at the height of his power.

674
36:10.780 --> 36:12.980
What makes you think he'll lose?

675
36:13.480 --> 36:14.170
First,

676
36:16.110 --> 36:17.860
we lost Shandong,

677
36:18.380 --> 36:20.610
and instead of defending the nation's interests,

678
36:20.610 --> 36:22.690
Premier Rui cracked down hard on the protesting civilians,

679
36:22.690 --> 36:24.350
losing the people's support.

680
36:24.880 --> 36:25.550
Second,

681
36:26.110 --> 36:26.800
he has no loyal troops

682
36:26.800 --> 36:28.130
of his own.

683
36:28.380 --> 36:29.630
The few divisions under his command

684
36:29.630 --> 36:32.840
are cobbled together from different forces and lack cohesion.

685
36:32.840 --> 36:35.340
So I'm betting on Third Master Cheng.

686
36:36.280 --> 36:37.210
If Marshal Xu

687
36:37.320 --> 36:39.030
can upgrade his weaponry

688
36:39.650 --> 36:41.190
and distinguish himself

689
36:41.280 --> 36:42.940
in Third Master Cheng's camp,

690
36:43.150 --> 36:45.110
it'll be an excellent opportunity

691
36:45.860 --> 36:47.720
to enter the central government.

692
36:51.980 --> 36:53.240
Our outdated weaponry

693
36:53.580 --> 36:55.900
and our distance from the center of power

694
36:56.130 --> 36:57.260
have always weighed heavily

695
36:57.260 --> 36:58.530
on the Marshal's mind.

696
37:00.730 --> 37:02.330
Although we've never worked

697
37:03.110 --> 37:04.730
with Yu Changxuan before,

698
37:04.730 --> 37:06.010
every word he said

699
37:06.010 --> 37:08.340
struck a chord with the Marshal.

700
37:23.570 --> 37:26.230
What have you been sneaking around doing

701
37:26.610 --> 37:28.440
all this time?

702
37:29.610 --> 37:30.670
You're clever

703
37:30.980 --> 37:32.040
and quick-witted,

704
37:33.090 --> 37:34.750
but your memory isn't so good.

705
37:38.460 --> 37:40.110
The more you know,

706
37:40.800 --> 37:42.110
the sooner you'll die.

707
37:47.380 --> 37:48.820
Can we go back now?

708
37:50.130 --> 37:52.340
We'll go back after spending the night here.

709
37:52.340 --> 37:53.360
If anyone asks,

710
37:54.130 --> 37:54.480
just say

711
37:54.480 --> 37:55.650
you stayed on the boat with me the whole time.

712
37:55.650 --> 37:56.360
No way.

713
37:57.940 --> 37:59.700
If I agree to that,

714
37:59.770 --> 38:01.520
my reputation will be ruined.

715
38:04.730 --> 38:05.400
You're already

716
38:05.400 --> 38:06.690
my woman.

717
38:06.880 --> 38:08.130
Even if you deny it,

718
38:08.770 --> 38:09.810
do you think they'll believe

719
38:09.810 --> 38:11.470
nothing happened between us?

720
38:14.030 --> 38:16.360
I've never met anyone as shameless as you.

721
38:16.730 --> 38:18.440
You'll stoop to anything

722
38:18.510 --> 38:20.190
to get what you want.

723
38:21.480 --> 38:23.210
Keep talking back to your boss,

724
38:23.800 --> 38:24.570
and you'll never get

725
38:24.570 --> 38:25.960
your indenture back.

726
39:13.240 --> 39:14.440
What are you reading?

727
39:20.380 --> 39:21.980
"Mu Guiying Takes Command."

728
39:23.460 --> 39:24.440
Pingjun,

729
39:24.630 --> 39:26.630
you're truly a heroine among women.

730
39:28.320 --> 39:29.520
What are you reading?

731
39:34.640 --> 39:36.370
[The Illustrated Original Edition of The Golden Lotus]

732
39:38.380 --> 39:40.180
A real ladies' man, as expected.

733
39:42.360 --> 39:43.550
I just pulled a book out of the drawer

734
39:43.550 --> 39:44.550
without looking.

735
39:45.870 --> 39:47.850
This really is Li Boren's boat.

736
40:47.260 --> 40:48.660
This boat isn't that big.

737
40:48.920 --> 40:50.650
Where do you think you can hide?

738
40:55.190 --> 40:56.850
From now on, you must look at me

739
40:57.360 --> 40:58.620
whenever I talk to you.

740
40:59.760 --> 41:01.160
You like people who obey?

741
41:02.800 --> 41:03.510
No.

742
41:04.630 --> 41:06.230
I like people who don't obey.

743
41:08.780 --> 41:09.480
I especially like

744
41:09.480 --> 41:11.480
seeing how disobedient people look

745
41:11.840 --> 41:13.500
once they've learned to obey.

746
41:39.530 --> 41:52.380
♪ A riot of colors ♪

747
41:53.880 --> 41:54.440
Listen.

748
41:54.900 --> 41:56.160
Isn't that beautiful?

749
41:58.510 --> 41:59.770
"A little tenderness.

750
42:00.400 --> 42:01.670
A touch of earth.

751
42:03.010 --> 42:04.070
A sweep of sunset".

752
42:07.320 --> 42:08.650
Even a little sincerity

753
42:09.780 --> 42:11.180
is like a ray of sunshine.

754
42:13.920 --> 42:15.720
It will find its moment to shine.

755
42:24.130 --> 42:25.610
You ask for no forever,

756
42:26.000 --> 42:28.000
just a fleeting moment of pleasure.

757
42:28.320 --> 42:29.280
Tell me, what woman in this world

758
42:29.280 --> 42:30.300
would believe

759
42:30.440 --> 42:31.000
such cold,

760
42:31.000 --> 42:32.490
hollow sweet talk?

761
42:33.050 --> 42:33.880
Only womanizers

762
42:33.880 --> 42:34.960
like you

763
42:35.510 --> 42:36.670
would mistake such nonsense

764
42:36.670 --> 42:37.570
for the truth

765
42:38.110 --> 42:39.530
and feel so smug about it.
